Package: midashisanmenkyo
Title: Same Event, Different Headlines (midashi-sanmenkyo)
Version: 0.0.1
Description: Snapshots multiple news RSS feeds hourly, clusters headlines
    about the same event across outlets via character-bigram cosine
    similarity, and publishes side-by-side comparisons with per-outlet
    lexical statistics as a static site. Built with build/, not R CMD build.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    xml2,
    dplyr,
    readr,
    ggplot2,
    glue,
    svglite,
    digest,
    tibble,
    stringi,
    tidyr
Suggests:
    testthat,
    jsonlite
